# The images every node runs, by digest. Nodes read this file from `main` every 15 minutes (update.sh).
#
# TANTIVE_IMAGE: verified with cosign (keyless, identity of the s1d1-tantive `build` workflow) before it is started.
#   BLOCKING FOR THE OPENING: replace the placeholder below with the digest of the published 0.8.0 image
#   (`docker buildx imagetools inspect ghcr.io/scombat/s1d1-tantive:0.8.0-small-onnx-int8`, line "Digest:").
#   Until then update.sh refuses this file (exit 1) and the nodes keep what they run.
# CLOUDFLARED_IMAGE: not signed by us, so not cosign-verified; it is pinned by digest and changes only through a
#   pull request on this file (cloudflared 2026.10.3, resolved 2026-10-24 with `docker buildx imagetools inspect`).
TANTIVE_IMAGE=ghcr.io/scombat/s1d1-tantive:0.8.0-small-onnx-int8@sha256:<to fill when 0.8.0 is published>
CLOUDFLARED_IMAGE=docker.io/cloudflare/cloudflared:2026.10.3@sha256:faa8e0a1475f137c910be6025f43c8e4092fdd35461b31e19fd1390657a1ff39
